//! The syntax layer of Constructo: the lexer, the parser, the tree of a value, the printer of values, the limits on
//! what is read, and the diagnostics, with what the codecs that `constructo codegen` generates call in `codec`.
//!
//! It is the part of `constructo` that code generated by `constructo codegen` depends on, so that the generated code
//! and `constructo check` read the same syntax. `constructo` re-exports these modules under the same names.

